WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.940
=Episode 31=

01:33.729 --> 01:34.729
But I promise you.

01:35.170 --> 01:36.039
Soon,

01:36.729 --> 01:38.200
you'll be more regretful.

01:42.530 --> 01:43.200
Rufei.

01:44.009 --> 01:44.960
Don't think

01:45.840 --> 01:46.960
becoming Marquis Wu'an

01:47.009 --> 01:48.650
makes you invincible.

01:49.759 --> 01:51.400
I killed you once,

01:52.009 --> 01:54.289
and I can kill you again.

02:01.600 --> 02:02.970
Killing trash like you

02:03.080 --> 02:04.600
isn't worth dirtying my sword.

02:05.040 --> 02:06.570
S-Stop...

02:09.479 --> 02:10.169
Since childhood,

02:10.759 --> 02:11.410
I've shouldered

02:11.480 --> 02:13.040
the family heir's responsibilities.

02:13.480 --> 02:14.410
I earned glory

02:14.760 --> 02:16.200
and the title of General Feihong

02:16.760 --> 02:18.250
to bring glory to our family,

02:18.690 --> 02:19.690
but I never imagined

02:19.690 --> 02:20.890
I'd nearly die

02:21.450 --> 02:23.170
by my own brother's hand.

02:26.010 --> 02:26.690
Master He,

02:27.410 --> 02:29.079
when you heard of He Yan's death,

02:29.480 --> 02:30.920
what did you feel?

02:31.410 --> 02:32.600
Bitter tears of grief

02:33.040 --> 02:34.520
or a wave of relief?

02:35.970 --> 02:36.920
This is

02:37.200 --> 02:38.570
our mansion.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.760
How dare you act recklessly here!

02:44.130 --> 02:45.410
Since you said so,

02:45.920 --> 02:47.480
if I don't make some trouble,

02:47.760 --> 02:49.200
it'd be impolite.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.800
What exactly do you want?

03:00.690 --> 03:01.640
I am

03:02.080 --> 03:04.890
very curious.

03:06.410 --> 03:08.920
Who exactly

03:09.480 --> 03:10.730
are you referring to?

03:13.970 --> 03:15.170
Second only to the Emperor

03:15.640 --> 03:16.890
and above all others.

03:18.170 --> 03:20.040
Who else could stir such chaos

03:23.130 --> 03:24.410
besides you,

03:25.800 --> 03:26.890
Chancellor Xu?

03:36.320 --> 03:39.079
Well played, General Xiao.

03:39.730 --> 03:40.890
With just a few words,

03:41.250 --> 03:44.130
you've slung mud at me

03:44.450 --> 03:46.200
and General He.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.600
Where's your proof?

03:49.170 --> 03:50.450
Surely not just

03:51.079 --> 03:53.290
your baseless accusations?

03:55.970 --> 03:57.200
No need to panic, Chancellor.

03:58.570 --> 03:59.890
How could you be certain

04:00.640 --> 04:01.640
we lack evidence?

04:25.890 --> 04:26.520
Taotao's drug

04:26.930 --> 04:28.250
actually works pretty well.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.840
(Just like when I lived here before.)

04:46.320 --> 04:47.570
(Almost nothing's changed.)

05:28.450 --> 05:28.960
Guards!

05:29.840 --> 05:30.400
Guards!

05:30.840 --> 05:31.960
Get in here now!

05:33.280 --> 05:33.810
Young Master.

05:33.840 --> 05:34.320
Master.

05:34.490 --> 05:35.010
Master.

05:36.450 --> 05:37.810
Untie me.

05:39.610 --> 05:40.200
Move!

05:41.280 --> 05:41.930
Where's He Yan?

05:42.520 --> 05:43.370
What are you doing?

05:43.930 --> 05:44.930
Find He Yan immediately!

05:48.010 --> 05:48.640
Rufei.

05:49.050 --> 05:50.159
Rufei!

05:50.930 --> 05:51.400
Master.

06:50.320 --> 06:51.050
The Linglong Box.

06:51.690 --> 06:52.450
Long time no see.

06:54.320 --> 06:54.890
Guards!

06:55.570 --> 06:56.130
Guards!

06:57.320 --> 06:57.960
Guards!

07:00.160 --> 07:01.280
Chaos finally erupts.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.200
Seal off

07:03.520 --> 07:04.280
the entire room.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.210
Don't let her escape!

07:05.490 --> 07:06.130
- Yes!
- Yes!

07:08.400 --> 07:09.570
They arrived faster

07:09.570 --> 07:10.320
than I expected.

07:11.130 --> 07:11.890
Good.

07:26.130 --> 07:26.690
She's after

07:26.690 --> 07:28.010
my letters with Chancellor Xu.

07:28.690 --> 07:30.520
(You won't leave alive.)

07:32.080 --> 07:33.159
Quick! Guards!

07:34.280 --> 07:34.960
Keep searching!

07:35.050 --> 07:35.370
Yes!

07:35.610 --> 07:36.250
Check this area.

07:36.610 --> 07:36.960
Yes.

07:37.400 --> 07:38.010
Any traces?

07:38.450 --> 07:38.890
Nothing.

07:39.200 --> 07:39.890
Keep looking.

07:40.080 --> 07:40.840
This area, too.

07:51.159 --> 07:51.610
Sir.

07:51.840 --> 07:52.570
Why are you here?

07:53.610 --> 07:54.159
For Sun Ling.

07:54.610 --> 07:55.080
Sir.

07:55.400 --> 07:56.890
This death row inmate is involved in

07:57.250 --> 07:58.130
a case supervised

07:58.159 --> 07:59.320
by the Ministry of Justice.

08:00.450 --> 08:01.050
Not long ago,

08:01.640 --> 08:03.490
he was transferred
from Yezhou for trial,

08:03.840 --> 08:04.690
waiting to be killed.

08:05.050 --> 08:06.760
The higher-ups
ordered strict supervision.

08:07.280 --> 08:08.130
Without a reason...

08:09.810 --> 08:11.520
It's you, Mr. Chu.

08:12.490 --> 08:13.250
This way, sir.

08:13.400 --> 08:14.080
After you.

08:16.280 --> 08:17.050
Right this way.

08:23.800 --> 08:24.560
Please enter, sir.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.210
You may leave now.

08:34.610 --> 08:35.039
Yes.

08:38.559 --> 08:39.130
Sun Ling.

08:45.090 --> 08:45.640
You...

08:46.560 --> 08:47.210
You are...

08:49.160 --> 08:50.800
C-Chu Zhao?

08:51.640 --> 08:52.250
It's me.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.330
You...

08:53.560 --> 08:54.250
Why are you here?

08:55.010 --> 08:56.160
You're behind bars

08:56.640 --> 08:57.640
and to be executed soon.

08:59.520 --> 09:00.210
I...

09:00.610 --> 09:01.250
I want to live!

09:01.730 --> 09:02.440
I want to live!

09:03.040 --> 09:03.560
Mr. Chu!

09:03.970 --> 09:04.560
Mr. Chu!

09:04.850 --> 09:05.490
I want to live!

09:05.680 --> 09:06.330
Save me!

09:06.440 --> 09:07.760
Save me! I don't want to die!

09:08.010 --> 09:09.040
Your crime is grave.

09:09.800 --> 09:10.970
No one can save you.

09:13.040 --> 09:13.640
But...

09:14.330 --> 09:15.250
But?

09:15.890 --> 09:16.440
But what?

09:16.890 --> 09:17.680
I can let you

09:18.520 --> 09:19.520
avenge your father

09:20.330 --> 09:21.640
while still breathing.

09:21.640 --> 09:22.700
(Account Book)

09:24.520 --> 09:25.520
This...

09:25.680 --> 09:26.490
This is the ledger

09:27.160 --> 09:28.370
of my father's transactions

09:28.890 --> 09:29.890
with Xu Jingfu!

09:30.400 --> 09:31.800
H-How did this end up with you?

09:34.040 --> 09:34.680
Correct.

09:35.130 --> 09:36.330
Your father worked diligently

09:36.730 --> 09:37.760
to embezzle money for him,

09:38.210 --> 09:40.010
only to be sacrificed as a scapegoat.

09:40.210 --> 09:41.760
Dragging your entire family down.

09:42.890 --> 09:44.090
Quite tragic.

09:49.010 --> 09:50.520
Stop the false compassion.

09:53.210 --> 09:54.490
You're partly responsible for

09:55.490 --> 09:56.520
my father's death.

10:01.400 --> 10:01.920
But

10:02.490 --> 10:03.890
(Account Book)
that old fox Xu Jingfu

10:04.250 --> 10:05.090
is the real culprit

10:05.130 --> 10:07.040
who destroyed my family!

10:08.090 --> 10:09.440
My father cherished me dearly.

10:10.330 --> 10:11.970
How could I not avenge him?

10:14.730 --> 10:16.300
(Transactions)

10:18.730 --> 10:19.330
Tell me.

10:20.250 --> 10:21.210
What should I do?

10:25.920 --> 10:27.800
I want you to surrender this ledger

10:28.760 --> 10:30.090
and expose

10:30.760 --> 10:32.400
Xu Jingfu's corruption and bribery.

10:46.680 --> 10:47.640
Officially,

10:48.520 --> 10:49.730
I was never here today.

10:51.130 --> 10:51.730
Correct?

10:53.090 --> 10:53.760
Yes.

10:55.090 --> 10:55.760
Yes.

11:28.280 --> 11:29.250
Father.

11:39.800 --> 11:40.440
Yan.

11:41.490 --> 11:41.970
Mother...

11:58.540 --> 12:02.250
(Spirit Tablet of Daughter He Yan)

12:02.250 --> 12:03.920
(She burns incense, chants scriptures)

12:04.490 --> 12:05.280
(and prays)

12:06.210 --> 12:07.010
(for me daily.)

12:09.280 --> 12:10.800
(So in this mansion,)

12:11.920 --> 12:13.560
(there's still someone
who remembers me,)

12:15.440 --> 12:16.730
(remembers He Yan.)

12:21.280 --> 12:21.760
Madam He.

12:22.610 --> 12:23.610
Is anyone in the shrine?

12:25.730 --> 12:27.090
Don't disturb my prayers.

12:27.280 --> 12:28.130
All of you, out!

12:29.250 --> 12:29.890
- Yes!
- Yes!

12:32.130 --> 12:32.730
Quickly.

12:33.210 --> 12:33.800
Leave!

12:35.970 --> 12:36.560
Go now!

12:36.970 --> 12:37.640
Hurry!

12:38.280 --> 12:39.090
Go!

12:48.920 --> 12:49.440
Anything?

12:49.920 --> 12:50.680
Nothing.

12:51.490 --> 12:51.970
Found her?

12:52.160 --> 12:52.920
- No.
- No.

12:55.130 --> 12:55.730
Rufei.

12:59.210 --> 12:59.560
What is

13:00.130 --> 13:01.440
all this commotion about?

13:01.970 --> 13:02.490
Madam.

13:03.040 --> 13:03.800
Did you happen to

13:03.800 --> 13:04.850
see anyone earlier?

13:06.400 --> 13:07.330
I haven't seen anyone.

13:24.760 --> 13:25.330
Rufei.

13:29.090 --> 13:29.730
Rufei.

13:38.860 --> 13:41.540
(Spirit Tablet of Daughter He Yan)

13:53.280 --> 13:53.970
Rufei.

13:59.760 --> 14:00.490
Rufei.

14:06.610 --> 14:07.970
Rufei, don't be like this.

14:08.130 --> 14:09.610
This is your sister's tablet.

14:10.040 --> 14:10.400
Don't.

14:10.400 --> 14:10.970
Let go!

14:13.010 --> 14:13.610
Rufei.

14:15.280 --> 14:17.040
You let her escape.

14:17.490 --> 14:18.680
Is that so?

14:38.760 --> 14:39.370
Enough.

14:39.920 --> 14:41.680
We've had enough tea.

14:42.090 --> 14:42.970
General Xiao.

14:43.330 --> 14:45.520
Since you intend to fabricate evidence

14:45.850 --> 14:47.250
to frame me,

14:48.040 --> 14:49.490
then go ahead quickly.

14:52.010 --> 14:52.490
My lord,

14:52.850 --> 14:53.400
Mr. Xiao's man

14:53.400 --> 14:54.160
is outside,

14:54.400 --> 14:54.890
saying

14:54.890 --> 14:55.920
to report something.

14:56.850 --> 14:57.440
Chancellor,

14:58.160 --> 14:59.560
my guard carries no weapons.

15:00.370 --> 15:01.800
Surely you won't obstruct him?

15:02.490 --> 15:04.040
You jest, General Xiao.

15:37.370 --> 15:39.040
Do you recognize this Linglong Box?

15:40.520 --> 15:41.090
Of course.

15:41.760 --> 15:42.850
After all, His Majesty

15:43.210 --> 15:45.160
publicly bestowed it
upon General Feihong.

15:46.090 --> 15:46.890
You

15:47.560 --> 15:48.440
surely remember.

15:52.520 --> 15:53.970
This is General He's stuff.

15:54.400 --> 15:56.250
How did this end up in your hands?

15:57.370 --> 15:58.560
Wasn't it you

15:59.730 --> 16:01.280
who told us to search for evidence?

16:03.490 --> 16:05.040
He Yan happened to be

16:06.040 --> 16:07.400
at the He Mansion today

16:07.890 --> 16:09.920
and retrieved her Linglong Box.

16:11.250 --> 16:12.130
This box contains

16:12.210 --> 16:13.730
intricate mechanisms,

16:14.640 --> 16:16.440
perfect for concealing important items.

16:18.400 --> 16:20.130
He Rufei thought the same,

16:21.680 --> 16:22.400
believing

16:23.090 --> 16:24.760
by keeping

16:24.760 --> 16:25.970
certain life-saving evidence

16:26.640 --> 16:27.560
in here,

16:28.800 --> 16:30.280
he could rest easy.

16:31.400 --> 16:32.210
Unluckily,

16:32.970 --> 16:34.640
it still fell into our hands.

16:35.520 --> 16:36.560
Send him out.

17:05.369 --> 17:05.890
Today,

17:06.240 --> 17:07.480
He Yan came to my residence,

17:08.160 --> 17:09.329
attempting to steal

17:09.770 --> 17:11.609
our letters.

17:13.530 --> 17:14.609
What a pity.

17:14.920 --> 17:15.810
Her schemes

17:16.089 --> 17:17.810
still failed.

17:19.050 --> 17:20.200
I never expected

17:20.640 --> 17:21.720
to find anything here.

17:22.530 --> 17:24.050
I got back this box

17:24.440 --> 17:25.200
simply because it

17:25.640 --> 17:26.770
belonged to

17:26.849 --> 17:27.890
General Feihong.

17:28.610 --> 17:29.290
Seeing this,

17:29.290 --> 17:30.480
Xu Jingfu would assume

17:30.890 --> 17:32.290
I've obtained evidence

17:32.680 --> 17:33.440
from He Rufei,

17:33.810 --> 17:34.960
regardless of

17:35.200 --> 17:36.160
its actual contents.

17:36.530 --> 17:37.810
After this,

17:38.370 --> 17:39.290
I doubt

17:39.370 --> 17:40.330
Xu Jingfu will continue

17:40.720 --> 17:41.810
to believe He Rufei.

17:42.570 --> 17:43.640
(To He Rufei)
Show me.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.720
The letters are safe.

17:52.160 --> 17:53.480
Rest assured, Chancellor.

17:54.570 --> 17:56.090
Then show me.

17:58.770 --> 17:59.440
Chancellor,

17:59.850 --> 18:01.200
you already know

18:01.290 --> 18:02.810
the content of these letters.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.240
You just need to know

18:04.480 --> 18:05.050
He Yan

18:05.370 --> 18:07.330
took no evidence with her.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.530
That's enough.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.850
You fear my scrutiny?

18:12.440 --> 18:13.090
Correct?

18:14.530 --> 18:16.570
You distrust me?

18:18.530 --> 18:20.370
Xu Jingfu is cunning.

18:21.240 --> 18:22.480
He won't trust easily.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.810
When I dealt with Xu Jingfu today

18:25.090 --> 18:26.960
at his mansion,

18:27.400 --> 18:28.720
he remained composed

18:30.240 --> 18:31.890
until he saw this Linglong Box.

18:32.610 --> 18:33.610
Then panic set in.

18:34.370 --> 18:35.200
Of course.

18:36.240 --> 18:37.720
He might disregard other things,

18:38.530 --> 18:39.530
but those letters

18:40.570 --> 18:42.890
were written by him personally.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.610
They're irrefutable evidence.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.160
He can't deny it.

18:46.370 --> 18:47.480
He Rufei doesn't

18:47.530 --> 18:48.610
trust Xu Jingfu either.

18:49.090 --> 18:49.770
It seems

18:50.440 --> 18:51.640
he wouldn't hand over

18:51.680 --> 18:52.810
those letters to him.

18:53.200 --> 18:53.890
After all,

18:54.570 --> 18:56.480
that's the only bargaining chip he has

18:56.480 --> 18:57.530
against Xu Jingfu.

18:58.240 --> 18:59.370
So from the beginning,

18:59.640 --> 19:00.680
my goal wasn't actually

19:00.890 --> 19:02.290
to obtain the so-called evidence.

19:02.850 --> 19:03.680
Time was too tight

19:04.090 --> 19:05.000
to find anything.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.160
It was just a feint.

19:08.290 --> 19:10.090
We just need to make Xu Jingfu believe

19:10.330 --> 19:11.720
that we've obtained evidence

19:12.160 --> 19:13.370
from He Rufei.

19:14.000 --> 19:15.480
Both of them harbor guilty secrets.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.240
Trust died long ago.

19:17.770 --> 19:18.810
The rupture awaits them.

19:19.480 --> 19:20.330
Just

19:21.290 --> 19:22.200
not tonight yet.

19:24.050 --> 19:24.920
No matter.

19:25.890 --> 19:27.400
It'll come soon enough.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.330
Enough.

19:29.810 --> 19:30.920
Keep these safe.

19:31.530 --> 19:33.640
Don't let them
fall into the wrong hands.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.090
Thank you, Chancellor.

19:36.570 --> 19:39.000
I'll guard them with my life.

19:45.610 --> 19:47.130
As you witnessed today,

19:47.530 --> 19:49.640
He Yan came to your mansion triumphantly

19:49.680 --> 19:50.770
to flaunt her victory.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.370
This was clearly retaliation.

19:53.570 --> 19:54.960
Xiao Jue and her

19:55.570 --> 19:57.440
came fully prepared.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.240
It appears

20:00.570 --> 20:04.240
we must strike first.

20:05.850 --> 20:07.130
What's your plan?

20:08.160 --> 20:09.680
We must deal with Xiao Jue now.

20:10.090 --> 20:10.770
At least,

20:11.130 --> 20:13.290
we must strip him of military authority.

20:13.610 --> 20:14.920
At the morning court in two days,

20:15.370 --> 20:17.770
I'll handle him myself.

20:19.200 --> 20:20.400
As for He Yan,

20:21.000 --> 20:22.610
that's your responsibility.

20:25.130 --> 20:26.810
At your service, Chancellor.

20:34.740 --> 20:38.210
(Xiao Mansion)

20:50.000 --> 20:50.810
Who is this?

20:52.370 --> 20:53.290
This is

20:54.770 --> 20:55.720
Madam He.

20:59.130 --> 21:01.530
(The Xiao Mansion
and He Mansion are far apart.)

21:02.330 --> 21:03.570
(She deliberately detoured,)

21:04.370 --> 21:05.770
(probably to see me.)

21:06.810 --> 21:07.440
Thank you

21:08.200 --> 21:09.050
for that day, madam.

21:11.920 --> 21:12.680
No need for thanks.

21:13.770 --> 21:14.640
I'm glad you're safe.

21:15.920 --> 21:16.770
It's all that counts.

21:18.890 --> 21:19.850
How have you been?

21:20.810 --> 21:22.570
Have your injuries healed completely?

21:24.240 --> 21:25.240
I've fully recovered.

21:25.610 --> 21:26.680
No need for concern.

21:26.890 --> 21:28.050
(Xiao Mansion)

21:28.050 --> 21:28.680
Yeah.

21:29.160 --> 21:30.160
Leaving the He Mansion

21:31.090 --> 21:31.920
was the best for you.

21:32.810 --> 21:33.480
Madam He.

21:34.290 --> 21:35.400
There are ears.

21:35.890 --> 21:36.480
Be discreet.

21:37.850 --> 21:38.160
But...

21:38.200 --> 21:39.130
Return home.

21:52.130 --> 21:53.000
Take care of yourself.

22:06.530 --> 22:07.200
Your Majesty,

22:07.920 --> 22:09.810
Wutuo envoy Maningbu

22:10.400 --> 22:12.440
arrived in the capital yesterday.

22:12.890 --> 22:14.000
In my humble opinion,

22:14.240 --> 22:15.200
we should host a banquet

22:15.610 --> 22:17.370
in three days

22:17.530 --> 22:19.240
to showcase

22:19.440 --> 22:21.610
our reputation as a civilized nation.

22:22.200 --> 22:25.240
What do you think, Your Majesty?

22:25.920 --> 22:26.530
Approved.

22:27.090 --> 22:28.610
Maningbu's visit

22:28.810 --> 22:32.000
is under orders from the Wutuo King

22:32.160 --> 22:34.200
to establish peace,

22:34.440 --> 22:36.000
cease hostilities between us,

22:36.130 --> 22:37.570
and establish a pact

22:37.640 --> 22:40.200
for perpetual amity.

22:51.810 --> 22:53.810
Wutuo has proposed three terms

22:54.090 --> 22:55.810
for the peace negotiations.

22:56.330 --> 22:56.850
First,

22:57.400 --> 22:58.890
Wei and Wutuo

22:58.890 --> 23:00.720
shall be brotherly nations.

23:01.200 --> 23:03.570
Your Majesty, being elder,

23:03.920 --> 23:06.850
shall be addressed
as elder brother by the Wutuo King.

23:07.200 --> 23:09.960
This hierarchy shall continue
for future generations.

23:11.400 --> 23:12.090
Second,

23:12.530 --> 23:13.960
both sides shall withdraw troops.

23:14.240 --> 23:16.570
Border cities
of both nations shall maintain

23:16.920 --> 23:18.160
current defensive structures.

23:18.720 --> 23:21.130
No new fortifications
shall be constructed.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.090
And the third point?

23:23.920 --> 23:25.330
Both sides at the border

23:26.050 --> 23:27.480
shall establish a market

23:28.000 --> 23:29.330
and conduct mutual commerce

23:29.810 --> 23:30.960
with profits split equally.

23:31.720 --> 23:33.640
That's the third proposal.

23:43.090 --> 23:43.680
Preposterous!

23:44.090 --> 23:45.400
Wutuo people are cunning.

23:45.680 --> 23:46.480
We can't trust them!

23:46.570 --> 23:47.200
- Exactly.
- No.

23:47.770 --> 23:48.920
If this can prevent war,

23:49.240 --> 23:50.530
it's worth trying.

23:52.770 --> 23:53.480
Chancellor Xu,

23:54.090 --> 23:54.680
Mr. Xiao,

23:55.130 --> 23:56.160
what are your thoughts?

23:56.770 --> 23:58.050
In my humble opinion,

23:58.370 --> 23:59.570
since we

23:59.610 --> 24:01.330
want friendly relations with Wutuo,

24:02.000 --> 24:03.610
establishing trade markets

24:04.000 --> 24:05.330
is acceptable.

24:05.960 --> 24:07.920
Our cooperation

24:08.050 --> 24:09.290
will bring mutual benefits

24:09.370 --> 24:13.200
and greatly aid
our people's livelihoods.

24:18.480 --> 24:19.200
Setting aside

24:19.810 --> 24:20.770
the fairness

24:20.770 --> 24:22.200
of this 50-50 split,

24:23.050 --> 24:24.400
I want to ask you,

24:25.290 --> 24:26.810
where does Wutuo plan

24:27.570 --> 24:28.640
to build this market?

24:30.440 --> 24:31.290
Mingshui.

24:33.680 --> 24:34.960
How can it be placed there?

24:40.160 --> 24:40.720
Outrageous!

24:40.720 --> 24:41.610
Unthinkable!

24:42.090 --> 24:43.000
This goes too far!

24:43.000 --> 24:43.770
A provocation!

24:43.770 --> 24:44.440
We cannot agree!

24:44.440 --> 24:45.330
A humiliation!

24:45.770 --> 24:46.640
Clearly intentional!

24:46.640 --> 24:47.160
True.

24:47.200 --> 24:47.920
We mustn't agree.

24:51.000 --> 24:51.570
Your Majesty,

24:52.200 --> 24:53.240
I object.

24:54.130 --> 24:54.810
Mingshui

24:55.290 --> 24:57.050
is our strategic border fortress.

24:57.370 --> 24:59.050
Placing the market there

24:59.480 --> 25:00.680
would leave Wei vulnerable

25:00.890 --> 25:02.090
if war reignites.

25:02.770 --> 25:03.370
Moreover,

25:04.160 --> 25:04.810
Mingshui

25:05.810 --> 25:07.680
holds the remains of 30,000

25:07.680 --> 25:08.440
Xiao Army soldiers.

25:09.290 --> 25:10.480
Does Wutuo's proposal

25:10.890 --> 25:12.090
show genuine sincerity

25:12.130 --> 25:13.530
for peace with Wei?

25:15.530 --> 25:17.640
This insults Wei's dignity!

25:18.530 --> 25:19.850
They hold treacherous intentions!

25:30.200 --> 25:31.090
The Xiao Army

25:31.290 --> 25:32.850
serves our nation.

25:33.160 --> 25:35.290
From marshals to foot soldiers,

25:35.610 --> 25:36.680
it is their duty

25:36.680 --> 25:38.090
to fall in battle.

25:38.400 --> 25:39.640
But General Fengyun,

25:40.050 --> 25:42.200
you cling to past grievances,

25:42.770 --> 25:44.570
ignoring the greater good.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.330
How does this honor

25:46.890 --> 25:48.370
our fallen warriors?

25:49.200 --> 25:50.640
Soldiers die in war,

25:51.570 --> 25:52.720
only to become

25:52.850 --> 25:54.050
bargaining chips for others.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.890
General He, if you want compromise,

25:55.890 --> 25:56.680
you may,

25:57.050 --> 25:57.680
but

25:58.160 --> 26:00.050
don't make your gains
off their sacrifice.

26:05.330 --> 26:06.200
To me,

26:07.810 --> 26:08.960
until we expose

26:08.960 --> 26:10.570
the Mingshui Battle traitor,

26:11.680 --> 26:12.530
this matter

26:14.050 --> 26:16.090
remains unresolved.

26:20.890 --> 26:21.570
Mr. Xiao,

26:22.290 --> 26:23.130
rise.

26:28.570 --> 26:29.160
Your Majesty,

26:29.770 --> 26:31.130
Wutuo's schemes are endless.

26:31.960 --> 26:33.090
Today's peace treaty

26:33.440 --> 26:34.960
will bring more demands tomorrow.

26:35.680 --> 26:36.240
Must we

26:36.850 --> 26:38.370
repeat the tragedies in Mingshui

26:38.400 --> 26:39.570
and Huayuan?

26:40.370 --> 26:41.640
How many armies do we have

26:42.090 --> 26:43.530
to feed Wutuo's slaughter?

26:44.570 --> 26:45.330
Next,

26:47.850 --> 26:49.400
shall we cede territory?

26:50.290 --> 26:50.960
Pay reparations?

26:51.850 --> 26:52.730
Offer peace marriages?

26:53.000 --> 26:54.570
- T-This...
- Yeah.

26:54.570 --> 26:55.440
He speaks the truth!

26:55.960 --> 26:56.960
There's no bottom line!

26:57.570 --> 26:58.160
How dare you!

27:02.130 --> 27:03.160
What's next?

27:04.160 --> 27:06.000
Wei's imminent collapse?

27:07.050 --> 27:08.440
Such audacity!

27:09.330 --> 27:10.400
Is it because I've treated

27:10.440 --> 27:11.330
you too kindly

27:11.640 --> 27:12.400
that you've become

27:12.400 --> 27:14.000
so oblivious to propriety,

27:14.480 --> 27:15.720
arrogant

27:16.000 --> 27:17.000
and insolent in court?

27:17.720 --> 27:18.720
Get out of my sight!

27:18.850 --> 27:19.610
Reflect at home!

27:49.890 --> 27:50.890
Establishing markets

27:51.570 --> 27:53.480
and signing treaties are important.

27:53.770 --> 27:54.640
We'll revisit this.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.000
Leave.

27:57.400 --> 27:59.370
Court adjourned.

27:59.920 --> 28:01.770
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.610
We mustn't fall into Wutuo's scheme.

28:09.640 --> 28:10.290
Indeed.

28:14.200 --> 28:16.050
Xiao Jue is already under house arrest.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.000
Why do you still appear

28:18.440 --> 28:19.530
so troubled?

28:20.090 --> 28:21.680
Xiao Jue is insignificant.

28:22.810 --> 28:24.570
I promised Maningbu

28:25.050 --> 28:26.290
that I'd ensure

28:26.720 --> 28:28.440
the trade market establishment.

28:29.290 --> 28:30.680
Earlier, His Majesty

28:30.720 --> 28:32.680
might've punished Xiao Jue,

28:33.610 --> 28:34.570
but he didn't approve

28:35.290 --> 28:37.200
the trade market proposal.

28:38.400 --> 28:41.000
He no longer obeys me

28:41.570 --> 28:44.050
as blindly as before.

29:07.440 --> 29:08.290
Is this fanfare

29:08.530 --> 29:09.240
enough?

29:10.050 --> 29:10.720
Any grander

29:10.890 --> 29:12.130
and Yaojing might gain

29:12.160 --> 29:13.640
a surplus of deaf citizens.

29:15.890 --> 29:17.370
Is this the top scholar's parade?

29:17.920 --> 29:19.330
No exams were held this year.

29:19.400 --> 29:20.570
No champion to celebrate.

29:20.920 --> 29:22.440
Besides, look at the rider.

29:22.610 --> 29:23.480
Rugged features,

29:23.480 --> 29:24.400
coarse demeanor.

29:24.680 --> 29:25.480
He's unlike

29:25.610 --> 29:26.850
any scholar.

29:26.960 --> 29:27.480
In my view,

29:27.720 --> 29:29.240
this must be a wedding procession.

29:29.640 --> 29:30.960
But no bridal attire.

29:31.050 --> 29:32.680
And marrying so late in life

29:32.960 --> 29:34.000
yet making a spectacle?

29:34.370 --> 29:34.920
How...

29:35.160 --> 29:36.570
How embarrassing!

29:36.680 --> 29:37.480
Shameful.

29:59.920 --> 30:00.370
Well?

30:00.680 --> 30:01.890
Did I do it well?

30:04.640 --> 30:05.130
Commander Li,

30:05.610 --> 30:06.400
long time no see.

30:07.370 --> 30:10.890
(Ganming Pavilion)

30:11.890 --> 30:12.680
Arrest the owner.

30:12.920 --> 30:14.290
He's a Wutuo spy in disguise

30:14.530 --> 30:15.770
who's lurked here for years.

30:15.960 --> 30:16.370
Everyone,

30:16.720 --> 30:17.530
bring all findings

30:17.640 --> 30:19.090
straight to the Ministry of War.

30:21.400 --> 30:22.810
(Ganming Pavilion)
Trinkets, toys.

30:22.920 --> 30:23.640
Take a look.

30:25.610 --> 30:26.640
Someone!

30:26.850 --> 30:28.090
Someone!

30:28.160 --> 30:29.400
Someone!

30:29.640 --> 30:30.330
Someone!

30:30.570 --> 30:31.160
Someone!

30:31.530 --> 30:32.050
Sun Ling,

30:32.240 --> 30:33.130
stay still!

30:33.610 --> 30:34.090
I...

30:35.530 --> 30:36.400
What are you doing?

30:37.200 --> 30:38.000
I demand an appeal.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.000
I accuse the current Chancellor

30:40.000 --> 30:40.770
Xu Jingfu!

30:40.810 --> 30:41.370
Nonsense!

30:41.850 --> 30:42.610
I'm not lying!

30:43.240 --> 30:43.890
This ledger

30:44.000 --> 30:44.770
is proof.

30:48.770 --> 30:49.330
With Li Kuang,

30:49.330 --> 30:50.890
General Feihong's old friend, here,

30:52.130 --> 30:53.610
Xu Jingfu and He Rufei

30:53.850 --> 30:55.130
must be losing sleep over this.

30:59.770 --> 31:00.400
More than that.

31:01.480 --> 31:02.330
Mr. Chu

31:02.770 --> 31:03.610
must have visited

31:03.640 --> 31:04.530
Xu Jingfu's residence,

31:04.890 --> 31:06.370
bearing more ill tidings.

31:24.530 --> 31:25.160
Sir.

31:30.370 --> 31:32.640
You've been occupied with state affairs.

31:33.680 --> 31:36.200
What brings you here today?

31:37.680 --> 31:38.680
I've learned

31:38.960 --> 31:39.440
Li Kuang

31:39.720 --> 31:41.200
entered the capital publicly.

31:43.400 --> 31:45.890
I've heard of it.

31:52.240 --> 31:53.200
What else?

31:53.960 --> 31:55.480
Speak plainly.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.850
Sun Xiangfu's son Sun Ling

31:59.160 --> 32:00.530
was brought to the capital

32:01.530 --> 32:02.610
and has completed trial,

32:02.770 --> 32:03.640
awaiting execution.

32:04.440 --> 32:05.570
Facing imminent death,

32:05.810 --> 32:06.920
he's making his last move.

32:07.850 --> 32:09.440
He suddenly surrendered an account book,

32:09.530 --> 32:10.130
saying

32:11.330 --> 32:12.050
to accuse you.

32:21.960 --> 32:23.440
What is he accusing me of?

32:26.090 --> 32:27.530
Of instigating Sun Xiangfu

32:28.570 --> 32:30.610
to commit large-scale corruption
and bribery.

32:36.960 --> 32:39.720
I underestimated this man.

32:40.290 --> 32:42.530
I always thought he was a fool.

32:43.240 --> 32:44.160
I never expected

32:45.000 --> 32:46.050
he would have

32:46.570 --> 32:48.960
the audacity for a deathbed struggle.

32:49.720 --> 32:50.920
I took the liberty

32:51.240 --> 32:52.570
of having this matter silenced.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.530
The account book is destroyed.

32:55.090 --> 32:56.090
As for Sun Ling,

32:56.290 --> 32:57.480
he's already on death row.

32:57.850 --> 32:58.960
Currently held in isolation

32:59.160 --> 33:00.000
under strict guard.

33:00.160 --> 33:01.680
There's no need to worry.

33:03.680 --> 33:04.440
Excellent.

33:05.770 --> 33:06.810
You're thorough.

33:18.680 --> 33:19.290
By the way,

33:19.810 --> 33:21.130
on my way here earlier, I heard

33:21.610 --> 33:22.960
the owner of Ganming Pavilion

33:23.330 --> 33:24.200
was arrested

33:24.570 --> 33:25.440
for unknown reasons.

33:31.130 --> 33:31.720
Master,

33:32.240 --> 33:32.960
are you alright?

33:37.240 --> 33:38.290
With Li Kuang's arrival,

33:38.720 --> 33:39.680
the closure of the shop,

33:39.960 --> 33:40.890
and Sun Ling's report,

33:41.640 --> 33:43.160
he will make desperate moves.

33:43.960 --> 33:44.640
Not enough yet.

33:46.370 --> 33:47.290
We need one last spark.

33:49.570 --> 33:50.240
But that spark

33:51.370 --> 33:52.810
will soon ignite the flames.

33:56.370 --> 33:57.080
Zilan,

33:58.040 --> 33:59.000
your information network

34:00.120 --> 34:01.560
is remarkably efficient.

34:05.080 --> 34:06.290
Merely hearsay.

34:08.650 --> 34:10.290
What a coincidence.

34:15.330 --> 34:16.330
My passing by

34:16.810 --> 34:18.040
wasn't accidental.

34:23.040 --> 34:23.770
It was Pingting

34:23.960 --> 34:25.400
who heard about their new tea

34:25.810 --> 34:26.920
and dragged me to sample it,

34:27.400 --> 34:28.690
preparing to buy it for you.

34:29.520 --> 34:30.480
But unexpectedly,

34:30.770 --> 34:31.850
the shop got into trouble.

34:32.920 --> 34:34.210
If you have doubts,

34:34.730 --> 34:35.480
simply ask Pingting

34:35.920 --> 34:36.810
to verify the truth.

34:43.210 --> 34:46.250
I was just asking.

34:46.770 --> 34:48.170
Don't take it to heart.

34:48.730 --> 34:49.440
Have some tea.

34:57.560 --> 34:58.040
Master.

35:04.600 --> 35:05.440
Chancellor,

35:05.770 --> 35:07.120
I come bearing

35:07.210 --> 35:08.040
His Majesty's decree.

35:08.770 --> 35:10.440
By the imperial decree,

35:11.170 --> 35:13.080
Wutuo insists on establishing the market

35:13.120 --> 35:14.960
at our strategic stronghold

35:15.290 --> 35:17.120
and demands equal profit splitting.

35:17.210 --> 35:18.690
They show no flexibility

35:18.890 --> 35:19.850
and lack sincerity.

35:20.480 --> 35:21.040
Therefore,

35:21.290 --> 35:22.730
further negotiations are pointless.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.170
Yes,

35:25.080 --> 35:26.080
Your Majesty.

35:28.650 --> 35:29.290
Please.

35:43.080 --> 35:44.250
Xu Jingfu must be

35:44.960 --> 35:46.290
in disarray by now.

35:47.040 --> 35:48.770
Mr. Chu is his prized student.

35:49.170 --> 35:49.810
He'll surely

35:50.170 --> 35:51.890
seek Mr. Chu's counsel.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.690
The question is

35:54.170 --> 35:55.690
what advice Mr. Chu will offer.

36:03.770 --> 36:04.370
Here.

36:05.520 --> 36:06.690
Take the white pieces.

36:07.370 --> 36:08.730
Try to break this deadlock.

36:17.960 --> 36:19.960
Chu Zhao is Xu Jingfu's student,

36:21.080 --> 36:22.690
so their methods align naturally.

36:23.810 --> 36:25.120
They'll likely escalate tensions

36:26.250 --> 36:27.560
to reap third-party benefits.

36:44.290 --> 36:47.170
This approach harms you

36:47.290 --> 36:50.370
without damaging the enemy.

36:52.560 --> 36:53.890
Don't you want to solve this?

36:54.650 --> 36:55.850
Only by burning our boats

36:56.290 --> 36:57.770
can we break this deadlock.

37:01.690 --> 37:03.000
Good.

37:07.560 --> 37:08.000
Master,

37:08.650 --> 37:09.690
General He is outside.

37:10.850 --> 37:11.960
Let him in.

37:15.040 --> 37:16.000
You have a visitor.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.000
I shall take my leave.

37:28.440 --> 37:29.080
Earlier,

37:29.560 --> 37:31.120
Maningbu sent word again.

37:31.650 --> 37:33.600
He says the banquet is the deadline.

37:34.250 --> 37:34.890
Chancellor,

37:35.810 --> 37:37.440
what should we do now?

37:42.000 --> 37:45.000
If His Majesty agrees,

37:45.480 --> 37:47.250
all will be well.

37:48.000 --> 37:49.440
If he refuses,

37:59.250 --> 38:02.040
we'll replace him
with someone compliant.

38:09.610 --> 38:12.870
(Xiao Mansion)

38:59.290 --> 39:00.290
Why is everyone here?

39:00.890 --> 39:01.730
Waiting for me?

39:02.080 --> 39:02.960
What can I do for you?

39:03.000 --> 39:03.650
Just tell me.

39:05.850 --> 39:06.370
Yan,

39:06.810 --> 39:07.850
I can't offer much help,

39:08.250 --> 39:09.250
but I'll await good news.

39:10.000 --> 39:10.650
I don't know

39:10.690 --> 39:11.810
what you're planning to do,

39:12.120 --> 39:12.770
but I'm certain

39:13.170 --> 39:14.560
you'll achieve your goal.

39:18.920 --> 39:19.480
Don't you have

39:19.480 --> 39:20.440
anything to tell me?

39:21.520 --> 39:22.480
Return victorious.

39:26.330 --> 39:26.960
Thank you all.

39:28.330 --> 39:29.170
Tonight's banquet

39:29.890 --> 39:31.370
will bring the final resolution.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.400
I'll reclaim what's rightfully mine.

39:37.260 --> 39:39.420
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

39:39.520 --> 39:43.440
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

39:43.620 --> 39:45.560
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

39:45.660 --> 39:50.590
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:02.680 --> 40:04.090
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:04.290 --> 40:05.710
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:05.970 --> 40:08.790
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

40:09.090 --> 40:10.490
♪Destiny is my creed♪

40:10.540 --> 40:11.940
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

40:12.090 --> 40:13.890
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

40:15.090 --> 40:16.560
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

40:16.730 --> 40:18.010
♪Gazing through the mire♪

40:18.190 --> 40:20.580
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

40:20.780 --> 40:22.830
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

40:23.970 --> 40:25.800
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

40:27.760 --> 40:30.680
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

40:30.770 --> 40:33.430
♪There must always be a longing♪

40:33.880 --> 40:38.950
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

40:39.280 --> 40:41.290
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:41.600 --> 40:45.250
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:45.480 --> 40:47.370
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:47.410 --> 40:51.250
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:51.600 --> 40:53.540
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

40:53.730 --> 40:57.550
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

40:57.810 --> 41:03.560
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

41:04.450 --> 41:09.920
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

